TITLE Stepwise addition of H2SO4 to pure water at pH 7.0 using REACTION steps

SOLUTION 1
    pH      7.0
    pe      4.0
    temp    25
    units   mol/L

REACTION 1
    H2SO4   1
    0.001  0.005  0.01  0.05  0.1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   sulfuric_result_v4.sel
    -reset  false
    -step
    -si     H2(g)

END
